From: Xilinx <xilinx@amd.com>
Date: Tue, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] microblaze: Refresh all context for binutils-2.46

All microblaze binutils patches accumulated and context-refreshed
for binutils-2.46. This single patch replaces the individual patches
(0003-0056 in the original series) which all had fuzz or failure
issues against binutils-2.46.

Upstream-Status: Submitted [microblaze upstream patches pending review]

Signed-off-by: Xilinx <xilinx@amd.com>

---
